@WietRob I have added a commit allowing model-specific threshold control, thank you for the suggestion!

Here is a sample config.
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
    "compaction": {
        "token_threshold": 100000,
        "context_threshold": 0.30,
        "models": {
            "opencode/minimax-m2.1-free": {
                "token_threshold": 50000,
                "context_threshold": 0.10
            }
        }
    }
}
```

It would be great help if you could test it out as well.

I tried methods mentioned in the linked issues ,but I didn't find any corrupted json file. 
